{
  "name": "logistics-claim-multi-agent",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "物流智能理赔审核 Multi-Agent 系统：LangGraph Supervisor 编排（材料解析 / 运单核验 / 历史工单核验 / 规则审核 / 风险评估 / 报告生成）+ interrupt 人工审批 + MCP 工具 + PostgreSQL/Redis",
